        <Text layoutX="34.0" layoutY="390.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="Meruem is a fearsome opponent with a nen type of emmiter, he possesses overwhelming physical strength, incredible speed, and near-impenetrable durability that make him vastly superior to both humans and other ants from the moment he emerges. His intelligence is equally fearsome, he gains the ability to use photon-like particles to sense life, read intentions, and amplify his power even further. Combined with his instinctive combat mastery and his commanding presence, Meruem represents the ultimate fusion of physical dominance, mental brilliance, and rapid evolution," textAlignment="JUSTIFY" wrappingWidth="538.0">
