        <Text layoutX="29.0" layoutY="98.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="Meruem, the Chimera Ant King from Hunter x Hunter, stands as one of the most powerful and intellectually advanced beings in the series. Born as the pinnacle of Chimera Ant evolution" textAlignment="JUSTIFY" wrappingWidth="233.0">
